{"title": "Disengage: Bonus Action", "pageid": 47761, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Disengage:_Bonus_Action", "categories": ["Class actions", "Bonus actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about the bonus action disengage action available to Beast Master companions. For the normal disengage action, see <a href=\"/wiki/Disengage\" title=\"Disengage\">Disengage</a>. For bonus action disengage available to rogues, see <a href=\"/wiki/Cunning_Action:_Disengage\" title=\"Cunning Action: Disengage\">Cunning Action: Disengage</a>.  </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Disengage_Bonus_Action.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Disengage_Bonus_Action.webp/300px-Disengage_Bonus_Action.webp, /w/images/b/bc/Disengage_Bonus_Action.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bc/Disengage_Bonus_Action.webp/300px-Disengage_Bonus_Action.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bc/Disengage_Bonus_Action.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Disengage: Bonus Action</b> is a bonus action granted to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ranger%27s_Companion\" title=\"Ranger's Companion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ed/Summon_Companion_Icon.webp/20px-Summon_Companion_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ed/Summon_Companion_Icon.webp/30px-Summon_Companion_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ed/Summon_Companion_Icon.webp/40px-Summon_Companion_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ranger's Companion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ed/Summon_Companion_Icon.webp/20px-Summon_Companion_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ed/Summon_Companion_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ranger%27s_Companion\" title=\"Ranger's Companion\">Ranger's Companion</a> creatures as part of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Exceptional_Training\" title=\"Exceptional Training\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Exceptional_Training_Icon.webp/20px-Exceptional_Training_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Exceptional_Training_Icon.webp/30px-Exceptional_Training_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Exceptional_Training_Icon.webp/40px-Exceptional_Training_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Exceptional Training\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Exceptional_Training_Icon.webp/20px-Exceptional_Training_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Exceptional_Training_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Exceptional_Training\" title=\"Exceptional Training\">Exceptional Training</a>. This ability allows them to use their bonus action to disengage from enemies and avoid opportunity attack.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nRetreat safely. Moving won't provoke <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack of Opportunity\">Opportunity Attacks</a>.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/42px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</dd></dl>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_Disengage_BonusAction</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Disengage_BonusAction\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_Disengage_BonusAction\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=NoCameraMove_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"NoCameraMove (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">NoCameraMove</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Disengage\"> Condition: Disengage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disengage_(Condition)\" title=\"Disengage (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Disengage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Disengage_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/Disengage_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Disengage_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4e/Disengage_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Disengage_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disengage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4e/Disengage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Disengage_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4e/Disengage_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disengage_(Condition)\" title=\"Disengage (Condition)\">Disengage</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 1 turn</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Can move without provoking <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack of Opportunity\">Opportunity Attacks</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Corvus_Celer\" title=\"Corvus Celer\">Corvus Celer</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Corvus_Major\" title=\"Corvus Major\">Corvus Major</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Lupus_Major\" title=\"Lupus Major\">Lupus Major</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Lupus_Optumus\" title=\"Lupus Optumus\">Lupus Optumus</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ursa_Ingens\" title=\"Ursa Ingens\">Ursa Ingens</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ursa_Major\" title=\"Ursa Major\">Ursa Major</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Verres_Calamitosus\" title=\"Verres Calamitosus\">Verres Calamitosus</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Verres_Major\" title=\"Verres Major\">Verres Major</a>\n</p>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715055337\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.067 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.072 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2635/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32139/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11190/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.021/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1255168/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n101.94%   63.395     30 Template:Trim\n100.00%   62.188      1 -total\n 99.05%   61.595      1 Template:Feature_page\n 19.09%   11.869      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 16.38%   10.184      1 Template:SmSAI\n 12.48%    7.763      4 Template:Icon_text\n 12.02%    7.472      1 Template:SmPass\n 11.46%    7.126      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 11.32%    7.041      3 Template:Icon_link\n 10.28%    6.394      1 Template:Condition\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:47761-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715055337 and revision id 287415. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}